{
  "case": "G005",
  "question": "降雨过程强度等级标准把单站/区域降雨过程强度划分为哪几个等级？",
  "expected_answerability": "answer",
  "request_id": "diagnostic-e2e-20261029-b6-v7-G005",
  "trace_missing": false,
  "wall_ms": 5425.723,
  "http_status": 200,
  "status": "answered",
  "answer": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-1",
        "text": "单站和区域降雨过程强度均划分为五个等级：特强（I级）、强（Ⅱ级）、较强（Ⅲ级）、中等（Ⅳ级）和弱（V级）。",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_e200afdb84551c903202568bf269f270",
          "chunk_81092c13a545997ad7c927cb8a0667b3"
        ],
        "verified": false
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-2",
        "text": "\n\n具体划分如下：\n\n1. 单站降雨过程强度按RSI值划分：1≤RSI≤4为特强（I级），4<RSI≤8为强（Ⅱ级），8<RSI≤12为较强（Ⅲ级），12<RSI≤16为中等（Ⅳ级），RSI>16为弱（V级）。",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_81092c13a545997ad7c927cb8a0667b3"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
        "claim_id": "claim-3",
        "text": "\n\n2. 区域降雨过程强度按RPI值划分：1≤RPI≤12为特强（I级），12<RPI≤24为强（Ⅱ级），24<RPI≤36为较强（Ⅲ级），36<RPI≤64为中等（Ⅳ级），RPI>64为弱（V级）。",
        "evidence_ids": [
          "chunk_81092c13a545997ad7c927cb8a0667b3"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
    "conflicts": []
  },
  "evidence_ids": [
    "chunk_e200afdb84551c903202568bf269f270",
    "chunk_81092c13a545997ad7c927cb8a0667b3",
